 BCPS Lab 7 - Spreadsheet Data Analysis

## Aim
To perform data analysis and calculations using LibreOffice Calc.

## Software Used
LibreOffice Calc

## Procedure
1. Opened LibreOffice Calc.
2. Entered data into a spreadsheet.
3. Applied appropriate cell formatting.
4. Used formulas and functions to perform calculations.
5. Organised data in rows and columns.
6. Analysed the results.
7. Saved the spreadsheet.

## Result
Learned to organise spreadsheet data and perform calculations using LibreOffice Calc.
